{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>When HaShem does good with us.</b> To add to the seven nations, as it is written: ״והרחבתי את גבולך״ — and we will do good for you from that good. And some say: they vowed to him the land of the Kenite, this being what is written regarding Abraham our father: ״את הקיני ואת הקניזי״. Therefore he is called by the name Kenite in many places, as it is written: ״וירא את הקיני״, ״ויאמר שאול אל הקיני״."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:16.522752783Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}